### Start the app first with the local profile:
### ./gradlew bootRun --args='--spring.profiles.active=local'

### All events
GET http://localhost:8085/events

### One event
GET http://localhost:8085/events/rock-cluj

### Unknown event: 404 application/problem+json
GET http://localhost:8085/events/nope

### Upcoming events in a city (stretch 1)
GET http://localhost:8085/events?city=cluj

### The most booked events (stretch 3)
GET http://localhost:8085/events/top?n=2

### Create an event: 201 with a Location header (stretch 4)
POST http://localhost:8085/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Folk Evening", "venueName": "Sala Polivalenta", "city": "Cluj", "startsAt": "2030-10-01T19:00:00", "capacity": 300}
